  "provenanceNote": "Authored by the phase implementing the adapter. This set is USED FOR TUNING and is therefore NOT an advancement gate. It exists so prompt work has somewhere legitimate to happen that is not the holdout. DEV-01..DEV-05 were the ad-hoc probes run before the adapter existed; they are recorded here rather than discarded so that no tuning input is unaccounted for. L3-2b ADDITIONS (DEV-16..DEV-30) target the four root-caused defects. They are NEWLY WRITTEN, not the B08/C11/B10 sentences: the L3-2 holdout has been opened and this phase does not tune against it. Those original sentences appear only in the Phase-2 root-cause reproduction and as unit fixtures for the specific rules they falsified, which Phase 2/4 requires by name.",
